{"server":"cn","storyId":"act33side_level_act33side_08_end","groupId":"act33side","stageId":"act33side_08","title":"终局倒计时","storyCode":"BB-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"ee3ea9850d15f4ad455dcc72fff13160f848b07a04475690144ba918cd5bc179","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"胜利的前夕，意外却终究发生。特蕾西娅意识到了博士刹那的混乱思绪。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡兹戴尔地区，荒野某处"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈——哈哈哈哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"预言？什么预言，阿斯卡纶没有杀掉我，没有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被言说的仍需辨别，被辨别的仍可更改——预言法术的本质不过是推测和计算，当然没什么无法违逆的命运！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"独眼巨人王庭就是一个天大的笑话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啐。真疼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有死在阿斯卡纶手里，我没有如自己预言的那般死在阿斯卡纶手里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么死的就该是她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她势必会来确认我的尸体，那么，你们就会钉住她的影子，撕扯她的身体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也受了伤，我也不是白白挨打......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们在做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这个时候，把武器，对准我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁收买了你们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"没有任何人，老大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"只是个借机上位的好机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好机会？确实是个好机会......巴别塔进了城，你们可以用我的人头讨好他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴别塔要是输了，你们也可以回到疤痕商场，把握住自己的处境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“疤眼”沉默地看着这些被他亲手安排在此的伏兵。\n风掠过，有一些自己的血腥味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好算计啊，老伙计们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"命运没有杀死他。确实。他做到了。他做到了逆转预言。\n然后他死在了自己亲手搭建的舞台上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_victoria"},{"type":"narration","text":"维多利亚，伦蒂尼姆"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"坐落在伦蒂尼姆中的庞大宫殿群总是过于安静。\n特雷西斯对生活在其中的麻木贵族嗤之以鼻，他唯独敬重一批又一批用生命为代价走到自己身前的同胞。\n哪怕他们举起的刀，指向的是自己——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德，对敌人留情只会害死自己。不要再犯相同的错误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，将军......我以为——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"专心应敌。这些埋伏在我们身边的叛徒恐怕已经准备了很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们拨动了维多利亚人的心弦。现在唯有我们自己能扑灭这场叛乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*古老的萨卡兹语*——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他轻细的密令声刚落，一道道身影已经无声无息地介入了混乱的现场。\n像一阵掠过的风，吹散了倾盆而下的暴雨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弃名死士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"退后。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔刺客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。这些人我们来处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔刺客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤莉叶，你和其他人继续。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤莉叶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"了解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——别想碰将军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤莉叶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别急，会轮到你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我是将军的卫官，刺客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤莉叶","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你最好把剑握紧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一道不显眼的弧线从尤莉叶的眼前扫过。\n凉意逼人。她浑身僵硬。\n她想起了在疤痕商场见到殿下的那天。\n那时，自己手中的刀甚至都不敢举起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足够了，曼弗雷德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们来到我的面前是为了追寻荣耀的死亡，而非怜悯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们正用生命向我证明他们所见之未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们正在进行一场赛跑，身处卡兹戴尔的她同样面临数不尽的威胁——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你们的终点，是我的，或是她的性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就给你们这个机会吧。来，杀死我，刽子手，不要让特蕾西娅失望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"倒计时\n2时7分21秒"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“破碎”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的王庭军","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"门，门破了！他们要进来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"倒计时\n1时33分48秒"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通知所有内应行动，缴械巡逻部队。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":true,"text":"城内防卫很薄弱，几乎只有军事委员会的城防部队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":true,"text":"在他们合流之前逐个击破。动作快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哪怕双方都尽量避免战火波及到城内，这也不太正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把所有情报传回给博士，行动小队加快速度，随时警惕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拔除军事委员会在广场上的旗帜，打开全城广播频段。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"倒计时\n49分59秒"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准备联系本舰接驳，尽快让殿下他们进入我们的控制区域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有通知阿斯卡纶的队伍，尽快会合。已经有三支小队提前完成了战略部署。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来去哪，凯尔希医生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......巴别塔旧址。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴别塔的旗帜已经很多年没有在那里升起来过了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯尔希走在街道上，前往巴别塔办事处的路线她依旧轻车熟路。\n街道上的萨卡兹们都在悄悄地行动起来，他们尽可能地爬上了建筑上的最高处，不约而同地将目光投向了城中的那处废墟。\n一面曾经消失在卡兹戴尔城内许多年的旗子缓缓升了起来——\n巴别塔，回来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g10_theresaoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra最近一次汇报，我们已经完全打通了五条要道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要顺利，此时此刻，凯尔希应该已经看见了熔炉的焰火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，卡兹戴尔的城防措施几乎都被瘫痪，我们可以登上那座城了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"但军事委员会不可能放弃卡兹戴尔，我们若想完全控制城市，还需要一些时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"到那时，我们可能无法完全避免对卡兹戴尔主城区的破坏——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我感受到了，他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们仍在这里，却不打算出手帮助任何一方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，我们的战斗多了几位傲慢的旁观者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......不同寻常的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几乎灼痛灵魂的杀心，凄苦，和决意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"军事委员会的刺客。他们从一开始就打算以城市为饵，重创巴别塔本部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"这也在预料之内。但这一次，我们没什么可博弈和算计的了，真刀真枪地击溃这些刺客，回到我们的城市吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"我会去控制舰船内的防御系统，并负责指挥防御。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必把又一次厮杀，带进那座余晖中的城市。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"倒计时\n22分48秒"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔，本舰联系上了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":true,"text":"暂时没有回应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":true,"text":"还，还在覆写城内广播的功率设置，尝试扩大范围。也许是本舰通讯暂时故障......我还在努力恢复通讯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"倒计时\n12分57秒"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生，我感觉到一些异样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的母亲......曾为每一个她所亲爱的生命设下咒文......当生命逝去，挽歌便会连接起我们的心神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但此刻，我并无恙，却......"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯尔希突然浑身冰凉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_abyss_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......巴别塔即使占领了卡兹戴尔，也势必损失惨重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯说得对，他们无法统一，萨卡兹的分裂会常态化。相当长的时间内，萨卡兹依然不可能从弱势群体变成世界的领导者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"重要的是，我向特雷西斯指出了另一道路。他在伦蒂尼姆的计划便有更大的机会成功，萨卡兹将用源石腐化大地，摧毁他们的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是很好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"有这样一个坚韧的种族成为我们的信徒，成为源石蔓延在幕布上的第一处闪亮的血渍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"对吧......我们......不需要毁灭他们，更不需要杀死她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"我......应该利用“文明的存续”，尝试更好地引导它潜在的性能，我没必要......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"内部序列开始检索，检索到管理员权限。\n已验证。权限正常。\n欢迎您，Dr.{@nickname}。\n已进入<color=#FF4200>（全舰防御系统）</color>。请确认下一步操作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"我真的该在此刻放纵巴别塔的行为吗？\n我真的要为了一个对阻隔层都缺乏认知的种族，放弃那遥远过去以百亿同胞牺牲换回的成果，放弃他们的血肉与歌谣，放弃他们跨越了万年等到今天的火种......放弃源石计划？\n如果......为了泰拉......让源石停下......如果特蕾西娅真的成功了......\n我们上万年的等待算什么？\n可难道，特蕾西娅和泰拉上的种族，真的就没有半点胜算？\n不，我怎么会如此天真呢。他们不团结，他们不理想，他们不发达......只是偶然幸存的生命。\n任何生命理应选择自我的希望。\n可我们没有时间了，可——\n祂近在眼前。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g10_theresaoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！你听得见吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......奇怪，博士的情感......有些异样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"强烈，激昂，带有......阴影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士到底......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n......\n看吧。\n那是传送门破碎的光火，像是一条阴燃的裂痕划过天空。\n直到数个世纪后才会消散于无形。\n群星从我们所站立的地方远去了，如夜晚的树叶。\n但塔卫二的航船还是来到了这片遍地瓦砾的废墟。\n那是生命。\n那是我们在末日后一度失去的东西，那是可以驱散一切氤氲黑暗的古老颂歌。\n<color=#888888>？？？</color>\n我们至今仍未明白生命是如何出现在茫茫星海之中的。\n但我想，我们都应该歌颂万物生灵，歌颂我们自己。\n源石是我们谱下的歌谱，是献给后来者的曲调。插手文明的演化是傲慢的，但我别无他法。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g11_rhodesdeck_bc"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"预言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我违背了诺言。我背叛了在时间中等待的她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"预言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是因为我爱着。爱着生命。爱着存在。爱是永恒的纯真。使我不去思考。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"预言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，学会去爱，学会去相信。你将不得不去思考，去引导，去直面山坡上总是尖叫着坠落的滚石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"预言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但......到最后......我相信，你会学会爱。那是永恒的纯真，是呼吸的儿女，是你我的本性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"预言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。凯尔希。先去周围看看，再去远一些的山那头看看。去寻找存在的形式......我得回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"预言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她曾教会我所有，曾热烈地探索这一切，但她已经变了，她不会给擅自行动的我留太多时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"预言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......下一次，再见吧。我们会再见的。凯尔希。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我相信它们。相信你，凯尔希。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凯尔希......我时间不多了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"去寻找生命的痕迹，去寻找希望与未来。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凯尔希......自己去得出答案吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"去找到你自己。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是否确认关闭全舰防御系统？\n......\n......\n......\n......\n......\n......\n......\n......\n......\n......\n......\n......\n......\n......\n......\n......\n......\n......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g10_theresaoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"已选择<color=#FF4200>（重启登舰身份验证）</color>。已确认。\n已选择<color=#FF4200>（重启全舰通讯模块）</color>。已确认。\nLoading......\n倒计时已归零。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_abyss_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"操作面板的荧光反射在博士的面罩上。\n随着屏幕关闭，面罩之下的人最终隐入黑暗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>如何评价为了维护族群的利益而不惜一切的人？</i>\n<i>有人称之为英雄。有人称之为传奇。</i>\n<i>可这样的名号往往只能扎根于战乱四起的年代。</i>\n<i>当短暂的和平年代到来之时，一夜之间，切实可触碰的传说们似乎都成为了故事中的泡影。</i>\n<i>听故事的孩子们会问，背负这些璀璨名号的人又为何全都销声匿迹了呢？</i>\n<i>......</i>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因为他们主动选择留在了过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"使命既已终结，他们所缔造的新时代也无需留下他们的一席之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"传奇已被遗忘。英雄无人铭记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而死亡终将如约而至，无人可逃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"责任将驱使英雄，用自己的死写下答案，踩出泥泞的路面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我们的宿命。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g12_sandstorm"},{"type":"narration","text":"1086年\n巴别塔离开卡兹戴尔的前夕"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许多年之后，许多自我们搭建起家园后便销声匿迹的遗落者会加入我们的事业......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们会背负上骂名，帮助我们结束这场争论。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许吧。"},{"type":"narration","text":"双子并肩站在一起。\n凭借黑色王冠储存的记忆，他们行走于当年的战场。一如往昔。\n两位混血的萨卡兹走下了魔王崩塌的车辇，走向了战场——\n走向了未来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那这就是我们的告别？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，在当年我们决定携手改变卡兹戴尔的地方，告别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕成为他们的魔王这么多年，有时，你......还跟以前一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在我们尚且年幼时，我常常因织衣而刺破手指，污染了卖给客人的长袍，你还记得吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"记得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那时你还是一个不被允许佩戴真剑的苦闷学徒，总想着有朝一日能成为卡兹戴尔的兵卒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那时的我，尚不理解我们为何要承受四处躲藏的命运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"终于有一天，王庭欣赏我的手艺，我得以面见以勒什。那时，我鼓起勇气向魔王发问——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们的未来在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他没有回答，只是将我赶了出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到后来我们疲惫地带兵回到故乡废墟的那天我才明白，我追寻的答案不在其他地方，就在“这里”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——在“卡兹戴尔”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卡兹戴尔只会因为我们中一人的离去而再度辉煌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但失败的注定是你，你一定要坚持吗？特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的身边也有许多人支持我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可更多数饱受压迫和欺凌的萨卡兹选择了反抗和暴力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"无论剩下的人是否愿意，他们迟早被这股浪潮裹挟，卷入其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我们这一代人总得做点什么。我不想，让这股仇恨从我的手中再传递给下一代继续轮回......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕未来不由我改变，但点燃火种的希望需要由我们来传递。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我也需要对那些追随我的人负责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"响应战争的声浪并非只来源于卡兹戴尔，这片大地已经没有我们的容身之所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我能做的，只有推他们一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我也会留在这里，留在新一代萨卡兹于未来回望的过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如你一般。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
